# GitLab CI/CD - Docker Build and Push to Docker Hub

## Project Overview

This project demonstrates a simple CI/CD pipeline using GitLab CI/CD. The pipeline automatically builds a Docker image from the application source code and pushes the image to Docker Hub.

---

## Architecture

```text
Developer
    |
    v
Git Push
    |
    v
GitLab Repository
    |
    v
GitLab CI/CD Pipeline
    |
    v
GitLab Runner
    |
    +--> Build Docker Image
    |
    +--> Login to Docker Hub
    |
    +--> Tag Docker Image
    |
    +--> Push Docker Image
    |
    v
Docker Hub Repository
```

