## Dockerfile

```dockerfile
FROM nginx:latest

COPY index.html /usr/share/nginx/html/index.html
```

### Explanation

- Uses Nginx as the base image.
- Copies the application file into the Nginx web root directory.
- Creates a custom Docker image containing the web page.

