## GitLab CI/CD Pipeline

### .gitlab-ci.yml

```yaml
image: docker:latest

services:
  - docker:dind

stages:
  - build

build-image:
  stage: build

  script:
    - docker build -t webapp:v1 .
    - docker images
    - docker login -u $DOCKER_USERNAME -p $DOCKER_PASSWORD
    - docker tag webapp:v1 sabareeshwaran6999/cicd_demo:v1
    - docker push sabareeshwaran6999/cicd_demo:v1
```

---

## Pipeline Explanation

### image: docker:latest

Provides Docker CLI inside the GitLab Runner container.

```yaml
image: docker:latest
```

---

### services: docker:dind

Starts Docker-in-Docker service so Docker commands can be executed within the pipeline.

```yaml
services:
  - docker:dind
```

---

### stages

Defines the pipeline stage.

```yaml
stages:
  - build
```

---

### docker build

Builds a Docker image using the Dockerfile.

```bash
docker build -t webapp:v1 .
```

Generated image:

```text
webapp:v1
```

---

### docker images

Lists locally available Docker images.

```bash
docker images
```

---

### docker login

Authenticates with Docker Hub.

```bash
docker login -u $DOCKER_USERNAME -p $DOCKER_PASSWORD
```

---

### docker tag

Tags the local image with the Docker Hub repository name.

```bash
docker tag webapp:v1 sabareeshwaran6999/cicd_demo:v1
```

Before:

```text
webapp:v1
```

After:

```text
sabareeshwaran6999/cicd_demo:v1
```

---

### docker push

Pushes the image to Docker Hub.

```bash
docker push sabareeshwaran6999/cicd_demo:v1
```

