## Conclusion

This project demonstrates a complete Continuous Integration (CI) workflow using GitLab CI/CD. Whenever code is pushed to GitLab, the pipeline automatically builds a Docker image, tags it, and pushes it to Docker Hub. The image can then be pulled and executed on any environment such as KillerCoda, Docker hosts, or Kubernetes clusters.

